  "decision": "Retain as the accepted PREEMPT_RT plus parity-SD result. PFCTRL closes the DMA transport blocker and the full hammer contract passes, but PREEMPT_RT does not recover LXP throughput or latency on this single-core 8 MiB NOMMU platform.",
